## Block Intro
Dear participant,

Thank you for taking the time to answer this survey.

Your participation will help inform policy discussions on the reduction of pesticide use in agriculture. The survey focuses on how people evaluate different possible public policies, such as taxes on pesticide use or a full ban.

The questionnaire will take approximately 15 minutes. Your answers will be treated anonymously and confidentially. There are no right or wrong answers: we are interested in your personal opinion.

Thank you.

